CLASS:PUBLIC
DESCRIPTION:---------------------\nMBA 547 Module 1 Exam\n-----------------
 ----\n\nThe exam will assess your knowledge of Module 1 concepts. There ar
 e 10 multiple choice questions and four open response questions. You have 
 two attempts to complete the quiz and there is no time limit. Any time you
  reopen a quiz in Canvas after submitting\, Canvas creates a fresh submiss
 ion and you are not able to see your responses from the previous submissio
 n. It is always a good idea to keep a copy of your responses when submitti
 ng a quiz.\n\nThe latest attempt will be recorded and graded.\n\nIf you ge
 t a "muted" message you can still continue with your remaining attempts. S
 imply use the "Take Quiz Again" button above the muted message. See image 
 below for reference. Having a "muted" message does not mean that your pre
 vious quiz attempt has been erased. If you are satisfied with your initial
  submission then you do not need to do anything.\n\n[Muted.png] (https://
 canvas.illinois.edu/courses/69168/files/22733538/preview?hidden=1)
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Module 1 Exam [mba_547_120265_260490]
URL;VALUE=URI:https://canvas.illinois.edu/calendar?include_contexts=course_
 69168&month=05&year=2026#assignment_1616396
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://instructu
 re-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/account_145590000000000001/attachments/2176028
 9/mobile_app.css"><div id="kl_wrapper_3" class="kl_flat_sections variation
 _2 kl_wrapper">\n<div id="kl_banner">\n<h2><span id="kl_banner_left"><span
  class="kl_mod_text">MBA 547</span></span> <span id="kl_banner_right">Modu
 le 1 Exam</span></h2>\n</div>\n<p>The exam will assess your knowledge of M
 odule 1 concepts. There are 10 multiple choice questions and four open res
 ponse questions. You have two attempts to complete the quiz and there is n
 o time limit. A<span>ny time you reopen a quiz in Canvas after submitting\
 , Canvas creates a fresh submission and you are not able to see your respo
 nses from the previous submission. It is always a good idea to keep a copy
  of your responses when submitting a quiz.</span></p>\n<p>The latest attem
 pt will be recorded and graded.</p>\n<p>If you get a "muted" message you c
 an still continue with your remaining attempts. Simply use the "Take Quiz 
 Again" button above the muted message. See image below for reference.<span
 >&nbsp\;</span><span><span class="ts-image ts-image-container"><span class
 ="ts-image">Having a "muted" message does not mean that your previous quiz
  attempt has been erased. If you are satisfied with your initial submissio
 n then you do not need to do&nbsp\;</span></span></span><span>anything.</s
 pan></p>\n<p><span><img id="12406354" src="https://canvas.illinois.edu/cou
 rses/69168/files/22733538/preview?hidden=1" alt="Muted.png" loading="lazy"
  data-api-endpoint="https://canvas.illinois.edu/api/v1/courses/69168/files
 /22733538" data-api-returntype="File"></span></p>\n</div><script src="http
 s://instructure-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/account_145590000000000001/attach
 ments/9675810/dp_app.js"></script>
END:VEVENT
